The image decoders of the rasterizer (src/img_png.c, src/img_jpeg.c,
src/img_gif.c, src/img_bmp.c, src/img_webp.c, src/img_vp8.c, src/img_vp8l.c)
are ports of the decoders of the Go standard library (https://go.dev:
image/png, image/jpeg, image/gif, compress/lzw, and the conversions of
image/draw and image/color, Go 1.27) and of golang.org/x/image (bmp, webp,
vp8, vp8l, riff, v0.46.0), which are distributed under the license below.

